<title>FRANCE: Moroccan importers seek 30,000 T durum wheat-trade.</title>
<headline>Moroccan importers seek 30,000 T durum wheat-trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private Moroccan operators on Thursday launched a tender to purchase 30,000 tonnes of optional-origin durum wheat for delivery between August 25 and September 15, European grain traders said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
